# Astro

Prefer Astro components, semantic HTML, and CSS. Ship almost no client JavaScript.

Do not add React, `@astrojs/react`, or shadcn React primitives.

Interactive patterns to use instead:

- Navigation and FAQ: `<details>` / `<summary>`
- Dialogs: native `<dialog>` plus a few lines of vanilla JS if required
- Forms: Tally embed from `site.forms.tallyFormId`, not a custom backend

```astro
<!-- ❌ -->
<MobileNav client:load />

<!-- ✅ -->
<details>
  <summary>Menu</summary>
  <nav>…</nav>
</details>
```

Keep `wrangler.jsonc` assets-only: `assets.directory` and `not_found_handling`. Do not add `main` or `@astrojs/cloudflare`.
